      <outline text="CD Player" title="CD Player" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/LoZazaMastro/CD-Player" description="Rediscover your audio CDs and fall in love with your music again: a native PS5 player with USB drive support, album art and reactive visuals."/>
      <outline text="SwanStationPS5" title="SwanStationPS5" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/darkxex/SwanStationPS5" description="SwanStationPS5 is a PlayStation 1 emulator that runs all games using SwanStation core."/>
      <outline text="ReKHCoM" title="ReKHCoM" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/darkxex/ReKHCom-PS5" description="Native PS5 port of Kingdom Hearts: Chain of Memories (The GBA Version). The European, US and Japanese cartridges are supported; the version is detected from the ROM you provide (no ROM is included)."/>
      <outline text="FFTARecomp" title="FFTARecomp" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/darkxex/FFTARecomp-PS5" description="inal Fantasy Tactics Advance, running natively on your PS5 (no ROM is included)."/>
      <outline text="Apotris" title="Apotris" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/darkxex/Apotris-PS5" description="Apotris is a block stacking game for the Gameboy Advance! It features satisfying graphics, responsive controls and a large amount of customization so that you can tailor the game to your preferences!"/>
      <outline text="DevilutionX" title="DevilutionX" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/darkxex/DevilutionXPS5" description="native PS5 build of DevilutionX, as an installed title (PPSA98514). It is a separate port from the payload one in Packaging/ps5 and does not replace it."/>
      <outline text="DriftCheck" title="DriftCheck" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/felipemelchior/driftcheck5" description="Controller tester: live sticks with circularity, a rest test that measures stick drift and suggests a deadzone, triggers, buttons, touchpad and motion sensors."/>
