      <outline text="ProsperoRadio" title="ProsperoRadio" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/bornaradusin/ProsperoRadio" description="Internet radio player for PlayStation 5 featuring thousands of stations worldwide, Radio Browser integration, favourites, DualSense controls, native audio playback, and a modern OpenGL interface."/>
