      <outline text="EVO Player" title="EVO Player" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/sainsaji/EVO-PLAYER-PS5" description="Media player for PS5 that plays video from USB or internal storage, with hardware decoding up to 4K, 10-bit HDR and surround audio."/>
