      <outline text="Crux2" title="Crux2" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/Press5elect/Crux2" description="PCSX2 (PlayStation 2) as a standalone PS5 title on RADV, with a controller-first Big Picture library, network shares, USB disc drives and RetroAchievements."/>
      <outline text="Prospero Hi-Fi" title="Prospero Hi-Fi" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/Anime0t4ku/Prospero-Hi-Fi" description="A Music Player for hombrew enabled PS5 with lossless audio as the main focus. It's heavily based on my MiSTer Hi-FI project."/>
