      <outline text="DevilutionX for PlayStation 5" title="DevilutionX for PlayStation 5" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/griches/PS5_DevilutionX" description="A PS5 homebrew build of DevilutionX, the source port of Diablo and Hellfire, as an installed title (PPSA99308) with a controller, a keyboard and a mouse."/>
