      <outline text="Doom 3 BFG" title="Doom 3 BFG" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://github.com/griches/PS5_Doom3" description="Doom 3 BFG Edition for PlayStation 5: a homebrew port of RBDoom3BFG on Vulkan (RADV) at 4K, with Doom 3, Resurrection of Evil and The Lost Mission. Bring your own BFG Edition data."/>
